BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (An investment meeting is often described as though it were a neutral container: people gather, review the same facts) Tj T* (and choose whether to proceed. In practice, the room is a decision system. It determines which questions become) Tj T* (decisive, whose conviction carries weight, how doubt is expressed and what kind of evidence can resolve it.) Tj T* ET
