BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (That system is the decision architecture. It is not the firm's sector thesis, brand or stated investment process. It is the) Tj T* (working arrangement through which a particular group turns incomplete information into a judgment. Two firms may) Tj T* (both say that they back exceptional founders in large markets while reaching opposite conclusions about the same) Tj T* (company for internally coherent reasons.) Tj T* ET
Q
