BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (Authority answers who can move the decision and under what conditions. It may sit with a sponsor, a partnership, a) Tj T* (specialist whose experience is trusted, or a formal committee acting within delegated limits. Authority can be explicit) Tj T* (in policy and still operate differently in the room. A vote may exist on paper while a respected domain investor) Tj T* (effectively defines the question everyone else must answer.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 58 424 cm
q
.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (The useful founder question is not simply, "Who is senior?" It is, "Whose judgment must become affirmative, and) Tj T* (what grants that judgment legitimacy here?" Rank, expertise, accountability, mandate and the ability to carry) Tj T* (follow-on work are different sources of authority.) Tj T* ET
Q
