.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (Conviction is more than enthusiasm. It is a willingness to act despite unresolved uncertainty. Different architectures) Tj T* (build that willingness in different ways: by surviving attack, recognizing an outlier, deferring to earned expertise,) Tj T* (accepting personal ownership, clearing every material objection or satisfying an institutional threshold.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 58 299.5 cm
q
.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (A strong meeting can therefore produce weak conviction. Participants may admire the founder and agree that the) Tj T* (market matters, yet no one has crossed the architecture's specific burden of belief. Conversely, a contentious) Tj T* (meeting can produce strong conviction when the disagreement isolates a risk that someone is prepared to) Tj T* (underwrite.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
