.643137 .352941 .164706 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 2 Tm /F2 9 Tf 11 TL (Read the room, not the temperature) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 58 237 cm
q
.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (Warmth, volume and airtime are poor substitutes for understanding the mechanism. What matters is how the room) Tj T* (converts belief into authority. Listen for who reframes the question, which objection changes the burden of proof and) Tj T* (whether anyone accepts responsibility for the remaining uncertainty.) Tj T* ET
