BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (The dispositive question is the question whose answer changes the state of the decision. It is narrower than "Do we) Tj T* (like the company?" and more consequential than a diligence checklist. It might concern retention, market size,) Tj T* (technical feasibility, sponsor commitment, partnership alignment or portfolio construction.) Tj T* ET
