BT 1 0 0 1 0 17.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (Finding it is the central discipline of reading an investment room. Until it is named, founders tend to answer every) Tj T* (objection equally. Once it is named, the evidence can be ordered around what the room is truly deciding.) Tj T* ET
