BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (The six architectures that follow are recurring patterns, not permanent labels. A firm may use more than one, and the) Tj T* (effective architecture can change with cheque size, stage, partner, reserve policy or the investment itself. Use the) Tj T* (framework to interpret a live decision, not to stereotype an institution.) Tj T* ET
