BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (Structured Disagreement is an error-finding architecture. The room assumes that shared excitement can hide a) Tj T* (shared blind spot, so it deliberately creates pressure against the emerging case. A participant may be asked to) Tj T* (articulate the bear case even when personally supportive. The aim is not balance for its own sake. The aim is to) Tj T* (expose the claim on which the investment most dangerously depends.) Tj T* ET
