q
.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 17.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (The best version distinguishes a difficult risk from a broken premise. It does not reward theatrical skepticism. It turns) Tj T* (doubt into a testable account of how the investment could fail.) Tj T* ET
