.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 44.4 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (Authority is split between the sponsor, who carries the affirmative case, and the process, which grants dissent a) Tj T* (protected role. A chair or lead partner may decide when the challenge has become rigorous enough, but no single) Tj T* (title makes an objection correct. Authority comes from the quality of the counter-case and the room's commitment to) Tj T* (examine it.) Tj T* ET
