.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (Conviction forms through survival. The room identifies the strongest failure mechanism, tests it against available) Tj T* (evidence and asks whether the upside remains worth owning after the case has been stripped of convenient) Tj T* (assumptions.) Tj T* ET
Q
