q
.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (Enthusiasm that depends on avoiding a difficult question weakens. Enthusiasm that becomes more precise under) Tj T* (challenge strengthens. The output is often a narrower thesis with clearer conditions, not a uniformly more optimistic) Tj T* (one.) Tj T* ET
