.101961 .094118 .082353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.9 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.5 TL (The room resolves disagreement by locating the crux: the factual or causal belief that separates the bull and bear) Tj T* (cases. It may request a customer reference, a cohort cut, a technical review or a reframed market analysis. If the) Tj T* (crux cannot be tested, the decision becomes whether the unresolvable uncertainty is acceptable.) Tj T* ET
